{
  "bodyHash": "4b72defa97993de7",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">✨让你的我的世界世界变得“蜂”光异彩🐝&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>自定义设计的蜜蜂纹理，为你的游戏体验增添一抹独特的色彩。<br></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br>纹理会随着季节自动变化！（可关闭）<span style=\"font-size:8px\"><br></span><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sapling\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌱 必须安装 Sapling 模组才能使此模组正常工作&nbsp;🌱</span><br></span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">⚙️此模组必须在客户端和服务器端同时安装，以便你看到与朋友相同的纹理 🤗</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-size:16px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1587/330/seasonal-bee-banners-04.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1587/331/seasonal-bee-banners-05.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1587/493/the-holiday-bee-collection-banners-01.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1587/494/the-holiday-bee-collection-banners-02.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">蜜蜂变体在世界中随机生成。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">重新打开世界时，蜜蜂会保留其皮肤！收集它们全部吧！🤗</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌸☀️🍂❄️</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">纹理会根据季节自动更改。当然，普通蜜蜂也会继续存在。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">季节日期：日 - 月</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌸春季：01-03 / 31-05&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;☀️夏季：01-06 / 31-08&nbsp; </span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 🍂秋季：01-09 / 30-11&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ❄️冬季：01-12 / 28-02 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🎄圣诞节：01-12 / 26-12</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我们还添加了一个命令，让你选择偏好的半球！北半球或南半球 😊 <br>（默认自动选择北半球）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> ‼️🏷️如果你希望某种蜜蜂纹理在全年保持不变，请确保在新季节开始之前</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">给它戴上命名牌！否则，它们会发生变化。‼️🏷️</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>命令<br></strong><em>⚙️</em><em>用于自定义你的体验。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>管理员工具</u></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> adminTools flipSeasonDatesToOtherHemisphere&nbsp;&nbsp; <em>| 切换半球</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> adminTools resetAllLoadedEntityTextures&nbsp;&nbsp; |&nbsp; <em>重置游戏中已加载的蜜蜂纹理</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> adminTools reloadConfigFile&nbsp; | <em>重新加载配置文件中的更改</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>配置值设置</u></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> setConfigValues showCurrentValues</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> setConfigValues disableSeasonsDuringHoliday (false/true)&nbsp; | <em>选项：禁用节日与季节纹理的混合。</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> setConfigValues nameTagPreventsTexture (false/true)&nbsp; | <em>选项：保存命名牌的纹理或禁用该功能。</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> /maplemods bee setConfigValues replaceSeasonalTextures &nbsp;|<em> 在做出更改后重新加载纹理。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>更新分类设置</u></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> updateCategorySettings _default&nbsp;&nbsp; | <em>禁用或启用原始蜜蜂纹理</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> updateCategorySettings <em>&lt;category&gt;</em> (disable/enable/setDate)&nbsp; | <em>自定义季节</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><u>更新纹理设置</u></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>/maplemods</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bee</span> updateTextureSettings <em>&lt;texture&gt;</em> (disable/enable) | <em>专门选择启用或禁用哪些纹理</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">非常兴奋终于设计并推出了我的自定义蜜蜂。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✨ 希望你喜欢看它们飞翔，就像我喜欢创造它们一样 ✨</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">季节纹理也适用于：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-chicken-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">小鸡们！🐥</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-creeper-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">苦力怕们！💚</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-rabbit-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">兔子们！🐰</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-frog-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">青蛙们！🐸</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-parrot-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鹦鹉们！🦜</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maples-pig-collection/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">猪猪们！🐷</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更多生物即将推出！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>",
